    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0001",
      "source": "`mediaCharacteristic`: A media characteristic to load the available media selection options for. The supported characterisics are: - [`audible`](avmediacharacteristic/audible.md) to return the group of available options for audio media in various languages and for various purposes, such as descriptive audio",
      "ko": "`mediaCharacteristic`: 사용 가능한 미디어 선택 옵션을 로드할 미디어 특성입니다. 지원되는 특성은 다음과 같습니다: - [`audible`](avmediacharacteristic/audible.md) to return the group of available options for audio media in various languages and for various purposes, such as descriptive audio",
      "sourceHash": "2adcad4d9ae62a154c63201cd49289bd2ec8cdd9d37161a75011aa951547fc40",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0002",
      "source": "[`legible`](avmediacharacteristic/legible.md) to return the group of available options for subtitles in various languages and for various purposes",
      "ko": "[`legible`](avmediacharacteristic/legible.md) to return the group of available options for subtitles in various languages and for various purposes",
      "sourceHash": "3b30bf276be77c00b3e4757da5cc1db195e48ef7ab1e70c940e1951895a713ec",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0003",
      "source": "[`visual`](avmediacharacteristic/visual.md) to return the group of available options for video media",
      "ko": "[`visual`](avmediacharacteristic/visual.md) to return the group of available options for video media",
      "sourceHash": "97d8b40858d996b0076c1062ffbef866032068a8b4753e64219966fc80e1eae3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0004",
      "source": "`completionHandler`: A callback that the system invokes after it finishes the loading request. It passes the completion handler the following parameters: - **mediaSelectionGroup**: The loaded media selection group, or `nil` if no group is available or if an error occurs.",
      "ko": "`completionHandler`: 시스템이 로드 요청 완료 후 호출하는 콜백입니다. 이 콜백에는 다음 매개변수가 전달됩니다: - **mediaSelectionGroup**: 로드된 미디어 선택 그룹이며, 사용 가능한 그룹이 없거나 오류가 발생하면 `nil`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d77cf454799e188eca4bc899125481d0dc9792c12b4c196b27b96d67f68270c9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0008:0005",
      "source": "**error**: An error object if the request fails; otherwise, `nil`.",
      "ko": "**error**: 요청이 실패한 경우의 오류 객체입니다. 그렇지 않으면 `nil`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "beb1ce695ceb49dc110398e60d4b5e9da4901ddfddc30c607d9f227968ae7fe4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
